        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=8\\frac{11}{16}$",
          "worked": "Multiply both sides by 30.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}6(x-4)+5(2x-5)&=90\\\\6x-24+10x-25&=90\\\\16x-49&=90\\\\16x&=139\\\\x&=\\frac{139}{16}\\\\x&=8\\frac{11}{16}\\end{align*}$$",
